Package: smotifrs
Title: Rust backend for smotif motif enumeration
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruben", "Dries", , "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drop-in Rust acceleration for the smotif R package: parallel
    enumeration of size-2 / size-3 / size-4 multi-cellular motifs in
    spatial omics graphs, plus direct parquet I/O for million-cell
    datasets. Distributed as pre-compiled binaries via R-universe.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
